@startuml
title SD-B10 Ubah Password Profil

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam BoxPadding 4
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #333333
    LifeLineBorderColor #999999
    LifeLineBackgroundColor white
    ParticipantBorderColor #999999
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #ECEEF8
    ParticipantFontColor #111111
    ActorBorderColor #999999
    ActorFontColor #111111
    GroupBorderColor #111111
    GroupBackgroundColor transparent
}

actor "Pengguna" as Pengguna
boundary "Halaman Profil" as HalamanProfil
boundary "Form Ubah Password" as FormPassword
boundary "Halaman Login" as HalamanLogin
control "PasswordController" as PasswordController
control "AuthGuard" as AuthGuard
control "SessionStore" as SessionStore
entity "Users Model" as User

Pengguna -> HalamanProfil : Membuka halaman edit profil
HalamanProfil -> FormPassword : tampilkan form ubah password
FormPassword --> Pengguna : form ubah password tampil
Pengguna -> FormPassword : Mengisi password saat ini
Pengguna -> FormPassword : Mengisi password baru dan konfirmasi
Pengguna -> FormPassword : Klik simpan password baru
FormPassword -> PasswordController : update(request)
PasswordController -> PasswordController : validasi input password
PasswordController -> AuthGuard : cek password saat ini
AuthGuard -> User : ambil user login
User --> AuthGuard : user object
AuthGuard --> PasswordController : hasil cek password

alt Validasi berhasil
    PasswordController -> User : update password terenkripsi
    User --> PasswordController : user diperbarui
    PasswordController -> AuthGuard : logout pengguna
    AuthGuard --> PasswordController : logout berhasil
    PasswordController -> SessionStore : invalidate session
    SessionStore --> PasswordController : session invalidated
    PasswordController -> SessionStore : regenerate CSRF token
    SessionStore --> PasswordController : token baru
    PasswordController --> HalamanLogin : redirect halaman login
    HalamanLogin --> Pengguna : masuk ulang dengan password baru
else Password saat ini salah
    PasswordController --> FormPassword : tampilkan error password lama
    FormPassword --> Pengguna : perbaiki password saat ini
else Password baru tidak valid / konfirmasi tidak cocok
    PasswordController --> FormPassword : tampilkan error validasi
    FormPassword --> Pengguna : perbaiki password baru
else Gagal menyimpan perubahan
    PasswordController --> FormPassword : tampilkan pesan gagal
    FormPassword --> Pengguna : password belum diperbarui
end

@enduml
